# Set to "true" on a self-hosted/local instance (e.g. running on your own
# Pekaway system) to show the "Deploy to Device" button. Left unset on the
# public demo instance - a public, unauthenticated deploy button could
# only ever target the demo operator's own devices, forcing real reboots/
# e-paper refreshes on their hardware with no benefit to the visitor. See
# components/deploy-dialog.tsx and hil/README.md's deploy section.
NEXT_PUBLIC_DEPLOY_ENABLED=true
